Resolved Python dependency versions and artifact hashes are recorded in backend/uv.lock. The frontend has no runtime package dependencies. Container tags are declared in their Dockerfiles and Compose files; pin image digests in your release process for fully immutable deployment.

No original client CSV data, complete bank reports, LLM weights or provider credentials are redistributed. The implementation does not call external autonomous agents. Permitted model identifiers must be configured to correspond to the case's approved model families.
